{% comment %}
  Renders promotion badges for Shopify automatic discounts on product cards and the product page.
  Current promotion: Black Friday / Cyber Monday 2026 (snippets/bfcm-2026.liquid), Nov 27 to Dec 3 PT.
  When a promotion ends, empty this snippet again; the card and PDP wrappers hide when it is empty.

  Accepts:
  - product: {Object} Product Liquid object
  - context: {String} "card" or "pdp"
{% endcomment %}

{%- render 'bfcm-2026', mode: 'badge', product: product -%}
